es together; a time to embrace, and a time to refrain from embracing;",[[[[39,41],[42,48]],[4]],[[[96,98],[99,106]],[9]]],"dual-hebrew"],"6":["A time to get, and a time to lose; a time to keep, and a time to cast away;",[[[[42,44],[45,49]],[5]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"7":["A time to rend, and a time to sew; a time to keep silence, and a time to speak;",[[[[70,72],[73,78]],[7]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"8":["A time to love, and a time to hate; a time of war, and a time of peace.",[[[[7,9],[10,14]],[1]],[[[27,29],[30,34]],[3]]],"crosswire-hebrew"],"20":["All go unto one place; all are of the dust, and all turn to dust again.",[[[[16,21]],[3]],[[[12,15]],[4]]],"crosswire-hebrew"]},"dby":{"5":["A time to cast away stones, and a time to gather stones together; A time to embrace, and a time to refrain from embracing;",[[[[39,41],[42,48]],[4]],[[[96,98],[99,106]],[9]]],"dual-hebrew"]},"webster":{"5":["A time to cast away stones, and a time to gather stones; a time to embrace, and a time to refrain from embracing;",[[[[39,41],[42,48]],[4]],[[[87,89],[90,97]],[9]]],"dual-hebrew"],"20":["All go to one place; all are of the dust, and all turn to dust again.",[[[[10,13]],[4]]],"dual-hebrew"]},"gnv":{"5":["A time to cast away stones, and a time to gather stones: a time to embrace, and a time to be farre from embracing.",[[[[39,41],[42,48]],[4]]],"dual-hebrew"],"20":["All goe to one place, and all was of the dust, and all shall returne to the dust.",[[[[11,14]],[4]]],"dual-hebrew"]},"dra":{"20":["And all things go to one place: of earth they were made, and into earth they return together.",[[[[21,24]],[4]]],"dual-hebrew"]}}}
